{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":236370,\"title\":\"Mastodon\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"You can start with a clean slate at any age. Even when you are 60 years old and it seems that everything is fine with you. Viktor Molodtsov, a lonely widower, an official of the \\\"old school\\\" of the Zauralsk city hall, who does not recognize modern technologies, suddenly finds out that he has an adult daughter in the capital… And she heads one of the departments of the Ministry of Digital and Advanced Development. Unlike her mild—mannered and out-of-date father, Ekaterina Kulik is very confident, tough and progressive - constantly modernizing all existing work processes. Well done \\\"by connections\\\" finds an opportunity to get a job as an ordinary employee in the Ministry. He is going to Moscow to find out if this is really his daughter, and if so, to gain her trust.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a3M23Two5kOQRXHTixDmus1xNHB.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eZgYoRrDMAidEVp6Xcx1f38CXwo.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":8.4,\"voteCount\":11,\"year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":24,\"createdBy\":[\"Stanislav Dovzhik\"],\"networks\":[\"Russia-1\",\"Premier\",\"Okko\",\"ivi\",\"Wink\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"RU\",\"name\":\"Russia\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2025-01-24\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1614298,\"name\":\"Marat Kim\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/13U70zSk0iX4jj41K8uDratDGgX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1437989,\"name\":\"Stanislav Dovzhik\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9PF9T6CEESUgAiO9TAemdnHCWtj.jpg\"},{\"id\":238524,\"name\":\"Fyodor Dobronravov\",\"character\":\"Виктор Молодцов\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ocwJKKKUjlimIpPCvt6BiLALLa.jpg\"},{\"id\":1354863,\"name\":\"Olga Medynich\",\"character\":\"Ек